Print every flag and where its value came from

Usage:
  strict show [args...] [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help             help for show
  -l, --loud             loudness, repeatable
  -m, --mode fast|safe   how to show (default "fast")
  -n, --name string      who to greet (default "world")
  -p, --port int         port to show (default 8080)
  -r, --rate float       rate to show (default 0.5)
  -t, --tag strings      tags to show, repeatable
